{"id":"6f6f7533b6b8d306","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies.md","title":"同一外延序数的不同增长层次","display":"ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies — 同一外延序数的不同增长层次","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies","aliases":["72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies"],"display":"ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies — 同一外延序数的不同增长层次","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]]","[[72-df-structured-tree-ordinal]]","[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]","[[72-thm-finite-hierarchy-values]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Definition2.16 and discussion §§2–3, print157–164/PDF169–176; local explicit comparison","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies — 同一外延序数的不同增长层次"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" href=\"?note=c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value\">72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c0b1d31927046ab\" href=\"?note=1c0b1d31927046ab\" title=\"72-df-structured-tree-ordinal\">72-df-structured-tree-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee59458b6acb7c90\" href=\"?note=ee59458b6acb7c90\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic\">72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fcd2431dc7fa995d\" href=\"?note=fcd2431dc7fa995d\" title=\"72-df-hardy-hierarchy\">72-df-hardy-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7432b8a48a477c7\" href=\"?note=e7432b8a48a477c7\" title=\"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy\">72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f6e6568ea7b179d6\" href=\"?note=f6e6568ea7b179d6\" title=\"72-thm-finite-hierarchy-values\">72-thm-finite-hierarchy-values</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Definition2.16 and discussion §§2–3, print157–164/PDF169–176; local explicit comparison"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline k\">\\(\\overline k\\)</span> 为有限树序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\mu\">\\(\\lambda,\\mu\\)</span> 由下式给出的两条基本序列构造。所有 G、H 以整棵树为参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:=\\mathsf L((\\overline{n+1})_{n\\in\\omega}),\\qquad\n\\mu:=\\mathsf L((\\overline{2n+2})_{n\\in\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda:=\\mathsf L((\\overline{n+1})_{n\\in\\omega}),\\qquad\n\\mu:=\\mathsf L((\\overline{2n+2})_{n\\in\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\mu\\in\\Omega_s,\\qquad\\lambda\\ne\\mu,\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\lambda)=v_\\Omega(\\mu)=\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda,\\mu\\in\\Omega_s,\\qquad\\lambda\\ne\\mu,\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\lambda)=v_\\Omega(\\mu)=\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_\\lambda(n)=n+1,\\quad G_\\mu(n)=2n+2,\\qquad\nH_\\lambda(n)=2n+1,\\quad H_\\mu(n)=3n+2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_\\lambda(n)=n+1,\\quad G_\\mu(n)=2n+2,\\qquad\nH_\\lambda(n)=2n+1,\\quad H_\\mu(n)=3n+2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限树前驱集合恰含较小的全部有限树，故两条严格递增有限基本序列都满足结构化条件。两个外延值都是 ω，而 G、H 在极限处分支选择第 n 项，代入有限值公式便得四个等式。它直接说明：忘掉基本序列后，不能把当前增长层次当作只由 von Neumann 序数决定的函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value","status":"resolved","id":"c9a2f15ef4424ad4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-structured-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"1c0b1d31927046ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-structured-tree-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"ee59458b6acb7c90","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-hardy-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"fcd2431dc7fa995d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"e7432b8a48a477c7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-finite-hierarchy-values","status":"resolved","id":"f6e6568ea7b179d6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-finite-hierarchy-values]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\overline k","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda,\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda:=\\mathsf L((\\overline{n+1})_{n\\in\\omega}),\\qquad\n\\mu:=\\mathsf L((\\overline{2n+2})_{n\\in\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda,\\mu\\in\\Omega_s,\\qquad\\lambda\\ne\\mu,\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\lambda)=v_\\Omega(\\mu)=\\omega.","display":true},{"tex":"G_\\lambda(n)=n+1,\\quad G_\\mu(n)=2n+2,\\qquad\nH_\\lambda(n)=2n+1,\\quad H_\\mu(n)=3n+2.","display":true}],"bytes":1884,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"}],"outgoing":["c9a2f15ef4424ad4","1c0b1d31927046ab","ee59458b6acb7c90","fcd2431dc7fa995d","e7432b8a48a477c7","f6e6568ea7b179d6"]}